---
type: event
name: test_failure_triage
description: Offer a focused diagnosis when a user reports failing tests.
version: 1.0.0
enabled: false
target_agent: "*"
input_prompt: The user reported test failures. Identify the exact failing test and error, inspect only the relevant code path, and propose the smallest evidence-backed correction.
trigger:
  on:
    - type: message
      match: "tests failed"
---
